gantt
title Release schedule
dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
axisFormat %d %b
excludes weekends 2026-10-12
todayMarker 2026-10-08
tickInterval 1week
weekday monday
section Development
Implement :done, code, 2026-10-01, 4d
Tests :active, crit, tests, after code, 3d
section Release
Review :review, after tests, 2d
Ship :milestone, ship, after review, 0d
Code freeze :vert, freeze, 2026-10-09, 1d
Announce :announce, after ship, 20h
click review href "https://github.com/reardan/w/pulls"
